# Cat design

TMA palette: `apps/mini-app/app/shared/tma/palette.ts` + `apply-cat-palette.ts` (maps to shadcn CSS vars on `.tma-frame`).

## Styling convention (Tailwind-first)

- **Layout / spacing / typography** → Tailwind classes + `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- **TMA runtime colors** (accent, dark/light) → `bg-tma-*`, `text-tma-*`, `border-tma-*` via CSS vars on `.tma-frame`.
- **Static screens** (outside TMA shell) → shadcn tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-cat-secondary`) or cat palette vars.
- **`useTmaApp()`** → `t()`, `lang`, accent logic — not inline palette on every leaf `div`.
- **Inline `style`** only when truly dynamic: drag transforms, pointer-driven values, or unmapped CSS vars.

Shared brand assets: `packages/brand/`. 3D cats: `packages/ui/src/3d/`, `packages/ui/src/components/cat/`.
